I don't think it's an exploit, because exercising stats is so easy
that you don't ever need to grind stats:

You gain strength from fighting monsters.
You gain dexterity from fighting monsters, or hitting them with
missile weapons.
You gain constitution from not being hungry.
You gain wisdom from casting spells.

As long as you aren't satiated, strained, or overtaxed -- then the
stat gains happen naturally.



